    "_about": "THE PIG (2026-11-05, 2nd pass: the face short and round to a big disc, the belly up, big hams, a jowl fold, pinker snout, ears and joints, dark trotters): a long deep barrel on short legs, the back level and a little arched over the loin, big round hams and a heavy shoulder, the jowl under a short neck; a conical head out to the flat snout disc with its two nostrils, the lop ears falling forward over the eyes; short legs on small cloven trotters with dewclaws; the curly tail kept (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): broad pointed flaps (sharp.js `fin`) out of the top of the head, leaning forward, the tips tipped further over, the hollow forward; the roots faired. (2026-11-08) The curled tail is drawn in 12 links (`links: true`), not the arc's default 5: its curl reads round, not polygonal, close up.",
